  "bodyHash": "CV4ESiWfvag=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Easy Shulker Boxes</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 讓你直接從物品欄中完整操作界伏盒。無需將盒子放置在地上，即可放入物品、取出物品、瀏覽內容並管理儲存空間。📦</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">靈感來自 Minecraft 現代的束口袋機制，此模組讓可攜式儲存變得自然直觀。使用滑鼠滾輪🖱️瀏覽存放的物品，精準選擇你想要的物品🎯，透過簡單點擊移動物品進出，利用滑鼠拖曳跨越多個欄位批量傳輸，或使用單物品模式進行精確的物品欄管理。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了原版界伏盒，此模組也支援終界箱，並可透過資料包擴展以支援其他模組的儲存物品。🔗</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">與單純的工具提示模組不同，這不是一個僅限客戶端的模組。它加入了真實的物品欄互動，必須同時安裝在客戶端和伺服器端。如果你只想在工具提示中預覽界伏盒的內容，請查看客戶端替代方案：</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shulker Box Tooltip</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（由</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/misterpemodder\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MisterPeModder</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">製作）。💡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">也在使用束口袋嗎？試試看 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bundle-upgrade\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Bundle Upgrade</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，它能為 Minecraft 的束口袋帶來同樣的遊戲品質提升！🎒</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">基於物品欄的儲存存取：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">直接從支援的儲存物品中放入和取出物品，無需將它們放置在世界中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">詳細內容預覽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">直接在物品工具提示中檢視存放的內容，輕鬆一覽每個儲存物品所含的物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選擇任何存放物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵精準選擇你想互動的存放物品，不再受限於最近放入的那個。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選中物品詳細資訊：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">瀏覽存放內容時，立即查看當前選中物品的附加資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速物品傳輸：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">將物品點擊到儲存物品上，或將儲存物品點擊到物品欄欄位上，快速移動物品進出。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨越多個欄位拖曳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在物品欄欄位上點擊並拖曳，批量放入或取出物品，實現更快速的物品欄管理。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精準物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Control</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Mac 上為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）來移動單個物品而非整組，精確控制傳輸數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">儲存填充指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可選擇在支援的儲存物品上顯示束口袋風格的填充條，一目了然地監控容量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智慧相容性指示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">視覺提示顯示持有的物品是否可以存入，以及內部是否已有相同物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自訂互動、控制、工具提示行為和視覺功能，以符合你喜歡的遊戲風格。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔗 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資料包驅動的相容性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可透過資料包加入對其他儲存物品的支援，實現與許多模組背包和儲存解決方案的整合。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器端均需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可直接在遊戲中透過模組選單進行設定（Fabric 上需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有設定檔位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，根據設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。對一個模組而言，不一定所有類型都存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kir_antipov\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Kir_Antipov</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 從其模組 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packed-inventory\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Packed Inventory</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 啟發了終界箱功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrniddala\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MrNiddala</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 啟發了透過在物品欄不同欄位間拖曳容器物品來放入或取出物品的功能。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bloomcraft\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bloomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/climate-rivers\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/climaterivers/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shroomcraft\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
